# Last Chance Survivor

Last Chance Survivor is a 2D multiplayer survival game focused on resource gathering, progression, and player interaction.

The project is being developed as part of our Software Engineering course and will include a frontend, backend, and shared database to support multiple users.

## Planned Features

- 2D multiplayer gameplay
- User registration and login/logout
- User profiles
- Multiple user roles
- Shared central database
- Resource gathering and survival mechanics
- Player progression and interaction
- Responsive and organized user interface

## Inspiration

The game is currently inspired by multiplayer survival games such as:

- MooMoo.io
- One Hour One Life

These games serve as general references for the survival, gathering, and multiplayer aspects of the project.

## Technologies

Programming languages, frameworks, and other technologies are still being determined.

